nceUrls":["https://www.instagram.com/p/DT8fYEEDQtn","https://www.instagram.com/p/DXY0_YijXsf"],"note":"Monthly dates throughout 2026; 8 retreats Nov 2025-May 2026."},"longStayPotential":{"value":true,"confidence":0.5,"evidenceUrls":["https://www.instagram.com/p/DT8fYEEDQtn"],"note":"Each camp is 5 nights / 6 days, repeated monthly; but the model is hotel-based with the padel club as the anchor."},"brandFit":{"value":false,"confidence":0.6,"evidenceUrls":["https://www.instagram.com/p/DXY0_YijXsf","https://www.instagram.com/p/DXY0_YijXsf?img_index=14"],"note":"Mass-market sports camp with budget pricing and 4-star hotel add-ons; weak fit with a private luxury estate."},"priorCommercialEvidence":{"value":true,"confidence":0.8,"evidenceUrls":["https://www.instagram.com/p/DXY0_YijXsf","https://www.instagram.com/p/DT8fYEEDQtn"],"note":"Delivered 8 retreats / 130+ participants in one winter; thanks posts for Dec 2025, Jan 2026 and Feb 2026 groups."},"commercialRisk":"medium","recommendedTrack":"scouting_stay","redFlags":["Pricing far below premium (EUR 299-368 for 6 days, accommodation not included)","Model depends on a top padel club next to a hotel; a private villa without courts does not match the product","Sister account @tenerifepadelcamp shares the same website (duplicate outreach risk)"],"missingInformation":["Whether the organiser would run a villa-based format with transfers to padel courts near Porto Rafti","Origin market of players (''from all over Europe'' only)","Follower count and engagement"],"summary":"Tenerife Padel Retreats is a proven, high-frequency winter organiser: monthly 5-night padel camps with dated winter editions (Dec 8-13 2025, Jan 11-16, Feb 1-6, Mar 1-6, Apr 5-10 2026) and a stated 130+ participants across 8 retreats from Nov 2025 to May 2026 (post DT8fYEEDQtn, DXY0_YijXsf). Groups of about 12-16 match the villa''s capacity. However, the product is budget (EUR 368 per person for 6 days, accommodation sold separately as a 4-star hotel add-on) 